a of this place we share in  the morning and reverence of the  clockwork goddess of heroes great and  small gone but never forgotten in  scp-2783  no act of courage or sacrifice will ever  be lost to time be sure to leave quietly  on your way out like we said before this  is a somber place now go check out  scp-1440 the old man that kills all  living things he touches an evil monster  created by scp foundation  scp-2419 the laughing men for more scps  linked to death the final frontier
 

